h-image-data-types","image":"/images/course/panel_otmlwidt.webp","learningPaths":[],"description":"Learn how to identify, convert, and manipulate different types of image data.","category":"paid","duration":50,"numModules":5,"availableLanguages":["en","jp"],"language":"en","detailsLink":"/details/work-with-image-data-types/otmlwidt","uri":"","version":"v1","access":{"hasAccess":false,"hasMatlabOnline":false,"isFreemium":false,"startDate":"","endDate":""},"inProduct":false,"source":"oc"},{"id":"","code":"otmldtm","type":"course","title":"Dates and Times","slug":"dates-and-times","image":"/images/course/panel_otmldtm.webp","learningPaths":[{"code":"lpmlmace","title":"MATLAB for the MathWorks Certified MATLAB Associate Exam","detailsLink":"/details/matlab-for-the-mathworks-certified-matlab-associate-exam/lpmlmace"}],"description":"Use MATLAB data types to work with timestamps and durations of time.","category":"paid","duration":80,"numModules":4,"availableLanguages":["en","jp","kr","cn","es","fr"],"language":"en","detailsLink":"/details/dates-and-times/otmldtm","uri":"","version":"v1","access":{"hasAccess":false,"hasMatlabOnline":false,"isFreemium":false,"startDate":"","endDate":""},"inProduct":false,"source":"oc"},{"id":"","code":"orcf","type":"course","title":"Curve Fitting Onramp","slug":"curve-fitting-onramp","image":"/images/course/panel_orcf.webp","learningPaths":[],"description":"Learn the basics of curve fitting using the Curve Fitter app.","category":"free","duration":75,"numModules":6,"availableLanguages":["en","cn","kr","jp"],"language":"en","detailsLink":"/details/curve-fitting-onramp/orcf","uri":"","version":"v1","access":{"hasAccess":true,"hasMatlabOnline":false,"isFreemium":false,"startDate":"2026-09-18","endDate":"2026-12-17"},"inProduct":false,"source":"oc"},{"id":"","code":"slbe","type":"course","title":"Simulink Fundamentals","slug":"simulink-fundamentals","image":"/images/course/panel_slbe.webp","learningPaths":[],"description":"Learn how to use Simulink, a graphical simulation tool for modeling dynamic physical systems.","category":"paid","duration":470,"numModules":10,"availableLanguages":["en","jp"],"language":"en","detailsLink":"/details/simulink-fundamentals/slbe","uri":"","version":"simulinkR2026a","access":{"hasAccess":false,"hasMatlabOnline":false,"isFreemium":false,"startDate":"","endDate":""},"retiredDetails":{"effectiveRetirementDate":"2027-03-13T00:00:00Z","localizedAlerts":{"cn":{"shortRetirementAlert":"本课程即将停用。","retirementAlert":"\u003cp\u003e要全面掌握 Simulink 的使用技能，我们建议参加以下学习路径中的课程:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style: revert;padding: revert;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/cn/details/lpslbsp?s_tid=ots_retirements\"\u003eSimulink 技能提升\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e《Simulink 基础知识》这门课程将在 R2027a 版(2027 年 3 月)停用。但课程进度和证书仍将可用。\u003c/p\u003e"},"de":{"shortRetirementAlert":"Dieser Kurs wird in Kürze nicht mehr angeboten.","retirementAlert":"\u003cp\u003eUm umfassende Kenntnisse im Umgang mit Simulink zu erwerben, empfehlen wir die Teilnahme an Kursen des folgenden Lernpfads:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style: revert;padding: revert;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/de/details/lpslbsp?s_tid=ots_retirements\"\u003eAufbau von Simulink-Kompetenz\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eDieser Simulink-Grundlagenkurs wird ab R2027a (März 2027) eingestellt. Der Kursfortschritt und die Zertifikate werden weiterhin verfügbar sein.\u003c/p\u003e"},"en":{"shortRetirementAlert":"This course will be discontinued.","retirementAlert":"\u003cp\u003eTo develop comprehensive skills on how to use Simulink, we recommend taking courses in the following learning path:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style: revert;padding: revert;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/details/lpslbsp?s_tid=ots_retirements\"\u003eBuild Simulink Proficiency\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis Simulink Fundamentals course will be discontinued as of R2027a (March 2027). Course progress and certificates will still be available.\u003c/p\u003e"},"es":{"shortRetirementAlert":"Este curso dejará de estar disponible.","retirementAlert":"\u003cp\u003ePara desarrollar habilidades avanzadas sobre cómo utilizar Simulink, recomendamos tomar cursos en la siguiente ruta de aprendizaje:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style: revert;padding: revert;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/es/details/lpslbsp?s_tid=ots_retirements\"\u003eDesarrollo de dominio de Simulink\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eEste curso de Fundamentos de Simulink dejará de estar disponible a partir de R2027a (marzo de 2027). El progreso del curso y los certificados seguirán estando disponibles.\u003c/p\u003e"},"fr":{"shortRetirementAlert":"Cette formation sera bientôt arrêtée.","retirementAlert":"\u003cp\u003ePour acquérir des compétences complètes sur l'utilisation de Simulink, nous vous recommandons de suivre les formations du parcours d'apprentissage suivant :\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style: revert;padding: revert;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/fr/details/lpslbsp?s_tid=ots_retirements\"\u003eDévelopper ses compétences en Simulink\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eLa formation « Fondamentaux Simulink » sera supprimée à compter de R2027a (mars 2027). La progression de la formation et les certificats resteront disponibles.\u003c/p\u003e"},"it":{"shortRetirementAlert":"Questo corso sarà sospeso.","retirementAlert":"\u003cp\u003ePer sviluppare competenze complete sull'utilizzo Simulink, consigliamo di seguire i corsi del seguente percorso di apprendimento:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style: revert;padding: revert;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/it/details/lpslbsp?s_tid=ots_retirements\"\u003eSviluppa competenze in Simulink\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuesto corso sui fondamenti Simulink verrà interrotto a partire da R2027a (marzo 2027). I progressi del corso e i certificati saranno comunque disponibili.\u003c/p\u003e"},"jp":{"shortRetirementAlert":"このコースは非公開になる予定です。","retirementAlert":"\u003cp\u003eSimulink の使用方法に関する包括的なスキルを習得するには、次の学習パスに含まれるコースを受講することをお勧めします。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style: revert;padding: revert;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/jp/details/lpslbsp?s_tid=ots_retirements\"\u003eSimulink の習熟度の向上\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eこの「Simulink 基礎」コースは、R2027a (2027 年 3 月) で非公開になる予定です。なお、コースの進捗状況と修了証は引き続きご利用いただけます。\u003c/p\u003e"},"kr":{"shortRetirementAlert":"이 교육과정은 중단될 예정입니다.","retirementAlert":"\u003cp\u003eSimulink 사용 방법에 대한 종합적인 활용 능력을 개발하려면 다음 학습 경로의 교육과정을 이수할 것을 권장합니다.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style: revert;padding: revert;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/kr/details/lpslbsp?s_tid=ots_retirements\"\u003eSimulink 사용 능력 쌓기\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e이 Simulink Fundamentals 교육과정은 R2027a(2027년 3월)를 기점으로 중단될 예정입니다. 교육과정 진도 및 수료증은 계속 제공됩니다.\u003c/p\u003e"}}},"inProduct":true,"source":"oc"},{"id":"","code":"otslbpm","type":"course","title":"Battery Pack Modeling","slug":"battery-pack-modeling","image":"/images/course/panel_otslbpm.webp","learningPaths":[],"description":"Use Simscape to implement cell-to-pack workflows, battery pack thermal modeling, and adding a cooling plate to battery packs.","category":"paid","duration":50,"numModules":5,"availableLanguages":["en"],"language":"en","detailsLink":"/details/battery-pack-modeling/otslbpm","uri":"","version":"simulinkR2026a","access":{"hasAccess":false,"hasMatlabOnline":false,"isFreemium":false,"startDate":"","endDate":""},"inProduct":true,"source":"oc"},{"id":"","code":"otmlmdt","type":"course","title":"A Tour of MATLAB Data Types","slug":"a-tour-of-matlab-data-types","image":"/images/course/panel_otmlmdt.webp","learningPaths":[{"code":"lpmlamp","title":"Advanced MATLAB Programming Skills","detailsLink":"/details/advanced-matlab-programming-skills/lpmlamp"},{"code":"lpmlmace","title"